    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "text": "這......不可能！外部人員進出萊茵生命大樓都需要經過嚴格的檢查，你是什麼時候——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_214_kafka_1",
      "text": "我想赫默大概能猜出來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "十天前"
